    "offered: tags Tags > Common tags offers, with the type and how it suggests the project's elements (an id suffix or prefix, or a field value).",
    "Forge tag names and the tags that hold the same items on each version, checked against the vanilla, NeoForge and Fabric convention tags of 1.21.5 and 26.3 and the Forge 1.16.5 tags.",
    "vanilla: forge: names that are vanilla tags on every version (1.16.5 too).",
    "modern: a Forge tag and its tag on NeoForge and Fabric (1.21.5, 26.3); on 1.16.5 a modern tag maps back to the first Forge tag listed for it. A forge: tag not listed keeps its path under c: (and a c: tag not listed keeps its path under forge: on 1.16.5).",
    "forge:glass/<color>, forge:glass_panes/<color> and forge:stained_glass/<color> have no c: tag of their own; c:dyed/<color> (all dyed blocks of the color) is NeoForge's own mapping. No counterpart on 1.21.5 and 26.3: forge:dusts/prismarine, forge:stained_glass, forge:stained_glass_panes, forge:storage_blocks/quartz."
  ],
